MODULE: ServedMonotoneDrainForgetsHighWater
TARGET: ServedMonotone
CLASS: Action
SUMMARY: the drain never advances the high-water mark, so a crash replay of an older entry regresses a key the served view already reflected
PERTURBS: Drain

--- FIND
    /\ hw' = IF applied + 1 > hw THEN applied + 1 ELSE hw
--- REPLACE
    /\ hw' = hw
--- END